        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>24-3/16 Inch Mounting Centers Brushed Stainless Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Offset Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pull is 25-3/16 inches long with 24-3/16 mounting centers. It has an easy to care for, brushed stainless steel finish. This Offset 24 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pull can be mounted on wood, glass, fiberglass, or metal doors. Choose your door's thickness below to ensure easy installation. The 24 Inch Offset Rectangular Door Pull can be used in commercial or residential settings. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/offset-8-inch-brushed-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>8 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/offset-12-inch-brushed-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>12 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/offset-36-inch-brushed-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>36 Inch Offset Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Doorware Designs RTOPULL24-630:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 25-3/16\" (640mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 24-3/16\" (610mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1\" (25mm) x 1/2\" (13mm)</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 2-5/16\" (60mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with removable rectangular rosettes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTOPULL24-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262423\"><b>DWD-RTOPULL24 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Offset 24 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "This Offset Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pull is 25-3/16 inches long with 24-3/16 mounting centers. It has an easy to care for, brushed stainless steel finish. This Offset 24 Inch Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pull can be mounted on wood, glass, fiberglass, or metal doors. Choose your door's thickness below to ensure easy installation. The 24 Inch Offset Rectangular Door Pull can be used in commercial or residential settings.",
